SUMMARY:Kids In Nature Day (Charlotte)
DESCRIPTION:Kids in Nature Day (KIND) is a free\, fun-filled\, hands-on adventure where kids and families get up close with nature! Activities include meeting animal ambassadors\, creating art from things found only in nature\, a guided nature hike\, exploring native plants and animals\, and more. NO REGISTRATION REQUIRED. \nLEARN MORE
URL:https://ncwf.org/event/kids-in-nature-day-charlotte/
CATEGORIES:Featured
END:VEVENT
