SUMMARY:Triad Wild! Supporter Social (Greensboro)
DESCRIPTION:You are invited to NCWF Triad Wild! Chapter’s Supporter Social for an evening of fun and collaboration! Join us at Oden Brewing to connect with like-minded people. This event will include a brief presentation on Triad Wild! initiatives\, a discussion on how to get involved\, and time for networking and socializing with fellow wildife-lovers. We hope to see you there! \nREGISTER HERE
URL:https://ncwf.org/event/triad-wild-supporter-social-greensboro/
CATEGORIES:Featured
END:VEVENT
