SUMMARY:Some Not-So-Scary Snakes (Southport)
DESCRIPTION:Join NCWF Lower Cape Fear Wildlife Chapter for a presentation by Ken Hackney\, herpetology educator and conservationist with the NC Wild Snake ID & Education Group and Coastal Snake Management. Reduce your fear and mistrust of snakes and learn about their role in our environment\, unique behaviors\, and how to identify them in the wild!  \nREGISTER HERE
URL:https://ncwf.org/event/some-not-so-scary-snakes-southport/
CATEGORIES:Featured
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://ncwf.org/wp-content/uploads/LCFWscarysnakes.jpg
END:VEVENT
